{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 1891144056923748035,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Life of a Packet (Receive Path)",
      "source_hash": 2777432187050742338,
      "context_hash": 17493929079162369709,
      "translation": "패킷의 일생(수신 경로)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:47.999027Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "From NIC DMA to application read(), step by step",
      "source_hash": 7114661598105088772,
      "context_hash": 5952820194350344315,
      "translation": "NIC DMA에서 애플리케이션 read()까지 단계별로 살펴보기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "DMA": "DMA",
        "NIC": "NIC"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:47.999027Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Overview",
      "source_hash": 11777448466030057203,
      "context_hash": 3499423931196401719,
      "translation": "개요",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:47.999027Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A TCP packet arriving at a server traverses roughly 8 distinct phases before the application receives the data.",
      "source_hash": 7905094041540190693,
      "context_hash": 18028938931694709510,
      "translation": "서버에 도착한 TCP 패킷은 애플리케이션이 데이터를 받기 전까지 대략 8개의 서로 다른 단계를 거칩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "TCP": "TCP"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:47.999027Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Each phase is handled by a different kernel subsystem, and the same `sk_buff` passes through all of them without data copying.",
      "source_hash": 18220346085621590711,
      "context_hash": 3553350689144330803,
      "translation": "각 단계는 서로 다른 커널 서브시스템이 처리하며, 동일한 `sk_buff`가 데이터 복사 없이 모든 단계를 통과합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널",
        "subsystem": "서브시스템"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:47.999027Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Phase 1: NIC DMA and interrupt",
      "source_hash": 17498320719845484565,
      "context_hash": 15110436112387566215,
      "translation": "1단계: NIC DMA와 인터럽트",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "DMA": "DMA",
        "NIC": "NIC",
        "interrupt": "인터럽트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:47.999027Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The NIC places received packets into a pre-allocated **ring buffer** via DMA.",
      "source_hash": 10233905292749064736,
      "context_hash": 2504407287390125271,
      "translation": "NIC는 수신한 패킷을 DMA를 통해 미리 할당된 **링 버퍼(ring buffer)**에 넣습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "DMA": "DMA",
        "NIC": "NIC",
        "ring buffer": "링 버퍼"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:47.999028Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Each ring entry (descriptor) points to a kernel buffer:",
      "source_hash": 8188110058209798366,
      "context_hash": 17787022631111962183,
      "translation": "각 링 항목(디스크립터)은 커널 버퍼를 가리킵니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "descriptor": "디스크립터",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:47.999028Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "When a packet arrives:",
      "source_hash": 12492205332428418376,
      "context_hash": 16839955234455203146,
      "translation": "패킷이 도착하면 다음과 같이 진행됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:47.999028Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "NIC writes packet data to the DMA buffer",
      "source_hash": 1228465486004664907,
      "context_hash": 15244260577483501556,
      "translation": "NIC가 패킷 데이터를 DMA 버퍼에 기록함",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "DMA": "DMA",
        "NIC": "NIC"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:47.999028Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "NIC sets the \"done\" bit on the ring descriptor",
      "source_hash": 11819826675238528704,
      "context_hash": 15038815039370174772,
      "translation": "NIC가 링 디스크립터에 \"done\" 비트를 설정함",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "NIC": "NIC",
        "bit": "비트",
        "descriptor": "디스크립터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:47.999028Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "NIC raises a hardware interrupt",
      "source_hash": 8151118486447672797,
      "context_hash": 12486218084770080978,
      "translation": "NIC가 하드웨어 인터럽트를 발생시킴",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "NIC": "NIC",
        "hardware": "하드웨어",
        "interrupt": "인터럽트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:47.999028Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Phase 2: NAPI polling",
      "source_hash": 12801403217566118959,
      "context_hash": 11688952635604235841,
      "translation": "2단계: NAPI 폴링",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "NAPI": "NAPI"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:47.999029Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The hard IRQ handler disables further NIC interrupts and schedules NAPI:",
      "source_hash": 13014623065259504183,
      "context_hash": 10236404399850058174,
      "translation": "하드 IRQ 핸들러는 이후의 NIC 인터럽트를 비활성화하고 NAPI를 스케줄링합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "IRQ": "IRQ",
        "NAPI": "NAPI",
        "NIC": "NIC",
        "handler": "핸들러",
        "interrupts": "인터럽트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:47.999029Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The `NET_RX_SOFTIRQ` softirq fires (on the same CPU) and calls `net_rx_action()`:",
      "source_hash": 14965401352775755334,
      "context_hash": 10399612785279874664,
      "translation": "`NET_RX_SOFTIRQ` softirq가 (같은 CPU에서) 실행되어 `net_rx_action()`을 호출합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "softirq": "softirq"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:47.999029Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "The driver's poll function builds `sk_buff`s from ring buffer entries:",
      "source_hash": 13857338526507349740,
      "context_hash": 8952484157528254820,
      "translation": "드라이버의 poll 함수는 링 버퍼 항목으로부터 `sk_buff`를 만듭니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "driver": "드라이버",
        "function": "함수",
        "ring buffer": "링 버퍼"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:47.999029Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Phase 3: Ethernet demux — __netif_receive_skb()",
      "source_hash": 4066402846885254988,
      "context_hash": 11445479013519184067,
      "translation": "3단계: 이더넷 역다중화 — __netif_receive_skb()",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:47.999029Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`napi_gro_receive()` either merges the packet with an existing GRO flow or delivers it to `__netif_receive_skb()`:",
      "source_hash": 13897147266645121393,
      "context_hash": 13435551640222110812,
      "translation": "`napi_gro_receive()`는 패킷을 기존 GRO 플로우와 병합하거나 `__netif_receive_skb()`로 전달합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:47.999029Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Phase 4: IP input — ip_rcv()",
      "source_hash": 3985161178243782886,
      "context_hash": 15710048665781171537,
      "translation": "4단계: IP 입력 — ip_rcv()",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:47.999029Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Phase 5: Netfilter INPUT hook and local delivery",
      "source_hash": 5687081417440790738,
      "context_hash": 6571172381143163593,
      "translation": "5단계: Netfilter INPUT 훅과 로컬 전달",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Netfilter": "Netfilter",
        "hook": "훅"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:47.999029Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Phase 6: TCP receive — tcp_v4_rcv()",
      "source_hash": 10973645696751990156,
      "context_hash": 665231023759926309,
      "translation": "6단계: TCP 수신 — tcp_v4_rcv()",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "TCP": "TCP"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:47.999029Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Phase 7: TCP state machine and socket queue",
      "source_hash": 15349080199297919457,
      "context_hash": 4043748878900325323,
      "translation": "7단계: TCP 상태 머신과 소켓 큐",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "TCP": "TCP",
        "queue": "큐",
        "state machine": "상태 머신"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:47.999029Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "For an ESTABLISHED connection receiving data:",
      "source_hash": 7088976324705688174,
      "context_hash": 7389515503993359279,
      "translation": "데이터를 수신하는 ESTABLISHED 연결의 경우는 다음과 같습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:47.999030Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Phase 8: Application read()",
      "source_hash": 16914404882127446663,
      "context_hash": 5482201043622417271,
      "translation": "8단계: 애플리케이션 read()",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:47.999030Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The application calls `read()` or `recv()`.",
      "source_hash": 1324693260779437957,
      "context_hash": 17179307851024268088,
      "translation": "애플리케이션이 `read()` 또는 `recv()`를 호출합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:47.999030Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "If `sk_receive_queue` is empty, it blocks (TASK_INTERRUPTIBLE).",
      "source_hash": 14854221724711631636,
      "context_hash": 5179531687159932008,
      "translation": "`sk_receive_queue`가 비어 있으면 태스크는 블록됩니다(TASK_INTERRUPTIBLE).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:47.999030Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "When `sk_data_ready()` fires, the task wakes:",
      "source_hash": 5595835600194840048,
      "context_hash": 16636319443511736043,
      "translation": "`sk_data_ready()`가 실행되면 태스크가 깨어납니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:47.999030Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "`release_sock()` processes the backlog: packets that arrived while the socket was locked are now handled by `tcp_v4_do_rcv()`.",
      "source_hash": 7828536582391593208,
      "context_hash": 9124969482069488090,
      "translation": "`release_sock()`은 backlog를 처리합니다. 소켓이 잠겨 있는 동안 도착한 패킷은 이때 `tcp_v4_do_rcv()`가 처리합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:47.999030Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Key counters to watch",
      "source_hash": 16105540474385469649,
      "context_hash": 3474840296565676102,
      "translation": "주시해야 할 주요 카운터",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:47.999030Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:11/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Further reading",
      "source_hash": 12384514314644059922,
      "context_hash": 10012231534452279124,
      "translation": "더 읽을거리",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
